#. module: powerbi_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:powerbi_portal.field_pbirs_discovery_config__soap_auth_mode
msgid ""
"'Windows Integrated' uses Kerberos/GSSAPI authentication (via requests-"
"kerberos - cross-platform, works on both Windows and Linux). On Windows it "
"can also use SSPI (via requests-negotiate-sspi) as a fallback. Requires the "
"Odoo service account to have a valid Kerberos TGT (via kinit/keytab on "
"Linux, or running as the AD account on Windows). Use 'explicit credentials' "
"if Odoo doesn't run as an account with PBIRS access (requires 'requests-"
"ntlm')."
msgstr ""

